#====================================================================
# DRAFT — CMake versioned shared-library links fail on OHOS HMDFS
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-openjpeg2-hmdfs-versioned-soname
trigger_tool:           cmake|make|install|conan
phase:                  linking|installation|packaging
error_signature:        Error creating symbolic link.*libopenjp2\.so|Operation not permitted.*libopenjp2\.so|cmake_symlink_library.*failed

severity:               3
category:               cmake|shared-library|soname|hmdfs
match_keywords:         VERSION, SOVERSION, symlink, libopenjp2.so, HMDFS, cmake_symlink_library, Operation not permitted
title:                  OHOS HMDFS 构建 CMake 版本化共享库时需避免符号链接链

root_cause:             CMake 为带 VERSION/SOVERSION 的共享库生成真实版本文件和未版本化符号链接；OHOS 真机的 HMDFS 工作目录拒绝创建这些符号链接，导致库已链接完成但构建在 cmake_symlink_library 阶段失败。
affected_scope:         在 OHOS HMDFS 目录原生构建使用 CMake VERSION/SOVERSION 属性的共享库，尤其是只需要 Conan 包内未版本化链接名的核心库配方。
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/o/openjpeg2/2.5.4; verify package/lib/libopenjp2.so is a regular file; run test_package and upstream BUILD_UNIT_TESTS programs

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           ohos-only-unversioned-shared-library
rec_description:        给上游 CMake 增加默认关闭的选项，仅在 OHOS 配方中跳过 VERSION/SOVERSION target properties，直接生成未版本化共享库；其他平台保持上游 SONAME 和符号链接布局。
rec_command:            cmake -DOPENJPEG_NO_VERSIONED_SONAME=ON ...
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               source-patch-and-conan-toolchain-option

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      build-on-symlink-capable-filesystem
fallback_description:   若 ABI 必须保留版本化 SONAME，则将构建目录迁移到支持符号链接的目标机文件系统，再把最终普通文件复制进包目录并核验 NEEDED/SONAME。
fallback_command:       readelf -d libopenjp2.so | grep -E 'SONAME|NEEDED'
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          runner-filesystem-policy

forbid_1_pattern:       ln -s.*ignore|cmake.*Operation not permitted.*ignore|skip.*cmake_symlink_library
forbid_1_reason:        忽略符号链接失败会留下缺少消费者链接名或损坏的安装布局，构建成功状态不可信。
forbid_1_consequence:   Conan package 可能缺少 libopenjp2.so，导致下游链接失败。

forbid_2_pattern:       remove.*VERSION.*all platforms|patch.*SOVERSION.*unconditional
forbid_2_reason:        无条件移除 VERSION/SOVERSION 会改变 Linux 等支持符号链接平台的 ABI 和安装布局。
forbid_2_consequence:   非 OHOS 消费者可能失去预期 SONAME 或版本化兼容链接。

principles:             P003,P005

causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             [E087,E129]
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

